{"about_the_game":"<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/990280/extras/9c374fa3ba23c15486339c742322a11f.avif?t=1572040969\" width=640 height=190 /></span><br><br>Olimdal is a simple, yet challenging puzzle game with beautiful interior environments, set in the authentic library tower of Olimdal.<br><br>The game is about a little wizard who got himself into a little trouble when trying to cast a spell from an unknown book. Spell made wizard's movements affect the movement of the surrounding objects. To break the spell you must find a tome from the highest room of Olimdal. In order to reach the tome room, you must get pass all the rooms while solving puzzles caused by your condition.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/990280/extras/9dd421844552da906fab3ddc8efdb837.avif?t=1572040969\" width=640 height=150 /></span><br><br>Olimdal introduces fresh take on a simple puzzle element, movement. You must solve the movement based puzzles and challenges by moving or trying to move.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/990280/extras/9518e9041430a76bda59020d7d773982.avif?t=1572040969\" width=600 height=196 /></span>","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"icon":"cc54c772f1798139b80dcd3ac09a26a72bd11822.jpg","localized_name":"Getting Used To It","name":"Getting Used To It","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/990280/cc54c772f1798139b80dcd3ac09a26a72bd11822.jpg"},{"icon":"ffdcf840da5c514006b01e9db509bcfda24107eb.jpg","localized_name":"Let Me Out!","name":"Let Me Out!","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/990280/ffdcf840da5c514006b01e9db509bcfda24107eb.jpg"},{"icon":"c00825c1d9bab3e4e456d943bd0f82281867d256.jpg","localized_name":"What Happened?",